# Managed Services canvas — top of mind

When the user states **what is top of mind** in the same turn as a canvas create/refresh (see skill `managed-services-weekly-canvas`):

- Add a **focus Callout** with their priorities in plain language.
- Highlight matching **agenda rows** via `Table` `rowTone` (`info` / `warning`); do not highlight the whole table one color.
- Embed only priorities the user gave or that were just placed on the agenda in Dataverse—no guessed focus.

